# Credentials are now entered in the app and stored encrypted, not in .env.
# Normal startup does not load this file. Set optional non-secret process variables
# in your shell or service configuration instead:
# SIMAX_DATA_DIR=data
# SIMAX_PG_SSL_ROOT_CERT=/path/to/postgresql-ca.pem
# SIMAX_MYSQL_SSL_CA=/path/to/mysql-ca.pem
# SIMAX_MQTT_CA_CERT=/path/to/mqtt-ca.pem
# For existing installations, see docs/credentials.md for one-time migration.
